uses distributed storage to ensure data persistence. The specific configuration parameters for each cache level
are shown in Table \ref{tab:cache}. The multi-version concurrency control (MVCC) protocol ensures cache consistency, and differentiated expiration strategies are set for
different cache levels. This mechanism effectively reduces system response time and improves memory usage efficiency.



