The data can be tabulated as an integer \emph{relation matrix}, in which each row corresponds to a particular regular expression (an \emph{error message} in what follows) and each column corresponds to a particular file.  Each entry records the number of times a given error message occurred for each file.  Return values to the operating system were not collected, though if desired these could have simply been added as additional ``messages'' as rows in the relation matrix.

