%every shortest path between $P_1$ and $P_2$ intersects only the neighborhood of $w$ but on exactly two non-adjacent vertices (in particular, there is a shortest path containing $w$). 
%there is a shortest bath between $P_1$ and $P_2$ containing $w$.
