\subsection{Evaluating Synchronized, Non-direct IO with System Calls}

\Cref{fig:gplot_sync_cost} compares the predictions of the models with the actual
IO costs of writing
$1\,024$ data chunks of size $1\,\KB$, with synchronized non-direct IO on the two
