The networks used for the stimuli are the same as in the original study~\cite{DBLP:conf/gd/MooneyPWK024}, 
i.e., Erdős–Rény random networks with 10, 25, and 50 vertices. 
The same procedure to generate node-link diagrams with different stress values was used, but the instances differ from those used in the original study, in case either MLLM may have seen them during their training.
